        <p class="mt-1 text-sm">The standard headline corporate income tax rate in Malaysia is 24% for resident companies. Qualifying Small and Medium Enterprises (SMEs) enjoy a reduced preferential rate of 17% on statutory income up to RM 600,000.</p>
