        <p class="mt-1 text-sm">Sole proprietorships and partnerships are not taxed as separate corporate legal entities. Business profits are passed through to the individual owners and taxed under personal progressive income tax rates (0% to 30%) using Form B.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">What is Section 107A and Section 109B withholding tax in Malaysia?</h3>
